  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Pat the beef dry, season well and brown it in the oil in batches, then set aside.",
    "Soften the onion in the same pot over low heat for 10 minutes, then add the garlic.",
    "Take the pot off the heat, stir in the paprika and caraway so they do not burn.",
    "Return the beef, add the tomatoes and stock, and simmer covered for 90 minutes.",
    "Add the carrot, pepper and potato and cook uncovered for another 30 minutes.",
    "Season to taste and rest for 10 minutes before serving with sour cream and parsley."
  ]
